              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThere are many Umbraco conferences held around the world.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe main one is codegarden which is held in Odense, Denmark, about a 10 minute walk away from the Umbraco HQ.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn 2019 approximately 750 people attended, making it the biggest codegarden ever.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
